  "Channels screen": "Zaslon Kanali",
  "Channels that steps 1 and 2 don't cover can get a guide from free, community-run public guides: <a href=\"https://epg.pw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">epg.pw</a> and <a href=\"https://iptv-epg.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">iptv-epg.org</a> (matched by guide id, a local station's call sign or the name), and Pluto TV's own guide from <a href=\"https://i.mjh.nz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">i.mjh.nz</a> for Pluto channels (matched by their Pluto id).  Your sources and your provider always come first.  TiviBro hosts nothing and sends no logins: the TV downloads the files itself, at most twice a day.  <a href=\"#help/public\">Learn more</a>": "Kanali koje koraci 1 i 2 ne pokrivaju mogu dobiti vodič iz besplatnih javnih vodiča koje vodi zajednica: <a href=\"https://epg.pw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">epg.pw</a> i <a href=\"https://iptv-epg.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">iptv-epg.org</a> (usklađuju se prema ID-u vodiča, pozivnoj oznaci lokalne postaje ili nazivu) te Pluto TV-ov vlastiti vodič s <a href=\"https://i.mjh.nz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">i.mjh.nz</a> za Pluto kanale (usklađuju se prema njihovu Pluto ID-u).  Vaši izvori i vaš pružatelj uvijek imaju prednost.  TiviBro ništa ne hostira i ne šalje prijave: TV sam preuzima datoteke, najviše dvaput dnevno.  <a href=\"#help/public\">Saznajte više</a>",
  "Channels were copied, moved or taken out": "Kanali su kopirani, premješteni ili uklonjeni",
