  "Create your own token at <a href=\"https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TMDB API settings</a>.  It is checked before saving, stays on this TV and is excluded from backups.  With a token saved, movies without details or posters are looked up on their own.  Saved tokens are never sent back to this page.": "Izradite vlastiti token u <a href=\"https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TMDB API postavkama</a>.  Provjerava se prije spremanja, ostaje na ovom TV-u i isključen je iz sigurnosnih kopija.  Kad je token spremljen, filmovi bez detalja ili postera traže se automatski.  Spremljeni tokeni nikad se ne šalju natrag na ovu stranicu.",
