  "In <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/iam-admin/serviceaccounts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Service accounts</a>, create one (no roles needed), open it, go to Keys, then Add key, Create new key, JSON.  A .json file downloads.": "U <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/iam-admin/serviceaccounts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Service accounts</a> napravi jedan (uloge nisu potrebne), otvori ga, idi na Keys, zatim Add key, Create new key, JSON.  Preuzima se .json datoteka.",
  "In Google Drive, share your shared drive (Manage members) or folder (Share) with the service account's email, as a Viewer.": "U Google Driveu podijeli svoj dijeljeni disk (Manage members) ili mapu (Share) s e-adresom servisnog računa, kao Viewer.",
