  "Many US channels come twice, on East and West (or Pacific) time.  Keep the feed you watch and hide the other copy.  Channels that only come in one feed are left alone.  The hidden feed is not used as a backup: it runs hours apart, so the TV never switches to it by itself.": "Mnogi američki kanali dolaze dvaput, po istočnom i zapadnom (ili pacifičkom) vremenu.  Zadržite feed koji gledate, a drugu kopiju sakrijte.  Kanali koji dolaze samo u jednom feedu ostaju kakvi jesu.  Skriveni feed se ne koristi kao rezerva: kasni ili žuri nekoliko sati, pa TV nikad sam ne prelazi na njega.",
